Nibwitz, a Gnome Warlock, trekked through the humid jungles of Stranglethorn Vale. He swatted away a mosquito and sighed, looking at his Succubus, Lilith. She floated idly, lashing her tail, ignoring the raptors nearby.

"Lilith, attack!" Nibwitz commanded.

Lilith yawned, then suddenly dashed forward—not at the raptor, but toward a passing Troll Hunter. She struck a seductive pose, blowing a kiss. The Troll stopped, dazed and hearts floating above his head, completely forgetting the battle.

"Lilith, no! The mob!" Nibwitz cried, casting Shadow Bolt frantically as the raptor charged.

By the time the Troll snapped out of it, Lilith was dead, and Nibwitz was running for his life.

**Answer:**
The skill is **Seduce**. While the Voidwalker is better for solo survivability, players often use the Succubus in PvP (World PvP and Battlegrounds) to crowd control (CC) enemy players with Seduce, making them appear more prevalent in the world. [end of text]


